	(text "=============================================================\nTINY-GPU CARRIER BOARD — SCHEMATIC OVERVIEW\n=============================================================\nSECTION A (left):    Power Distribution\n  J1   USB-C Receptacle (5V/3A via 5.1k CC resistors)\n  U1   TPS62130 Buck — 5V→1.0V/3A  (VCCINT + VCCBRAM)\n  U2   TPS62130 Buck — 5V→1.8V/3A  (VCCAUX + MGTAVCC + MGTVCCAUX)\n  U3   TPS62130 Buck — 5V→1.35V/2A (VCCO_DDR / DDR3L VDD/VDDQ)\n  U4   AP2112K-3.3 LDO — 5V→3.3V   (VCCO_HR banks 14/15, 3V3_IO)\n\nSECTION B (center-left): FPGA\n  U_FPGA  XC7A100T-2FGG484I (Artix-7)\n  Crystal 200MHz diff LVDS reference clock\n  Power sequencing: VCCINT/VCCBRAM → VCCAUX → VCCO\n  Decoupling: 100nF per VCCINT/VCCAUX pin + 10uF bulk per rail\n\nSECTION C (center-right): DDR3L Memory  \n  U5-U12  MT41K256M16TW-107:P  (8× x16 chips = 128-bit bus)\n  4 groups of 2 chips per DQS group\n  ZQ calibration: 240Ω from ZQ to VSSQ on each chip\n  VREFDQ = VREFCA = VCCO_DDR / 2 = 0.675V via resistor divider\n  Fly-by topology for address/command bus\n  Series 33Ω source termination on DQ/DQS signals\n\nSECTION D (right): HDMI Output\n  U13  SII9022ACNU HDMI Transmitter (QFN-72, 10x10mm)\n  J2   HDMI Type-A connector\n  Core VCC12 = 1.2V (from additional LDO off 1.8V rail)\n  I/O VCC = 3.3V (supports 165MHz dual-edge mode)\n  AC coupling caps 100nF on TMDS outputs\n  DDC I2C lines with 4.7kΩ pull-ups to 3.3V\n\nSECTION E (right): Configuration\n  J3   JTAG 2×7 header (Xilinx JTAG-compatible 14-pin)\n  U14  W25Q128JVSIQ SPI Flash (128Mbit SOIC-8)\n  Configuration mode: Master SPI (M[2:0]=001)\n  DONE LED with 1kΩ series resistor\n\n!!! IMPORTANT — BEFORE FAB !!!\n  SII9022ACNU pin numbers marked NEEDS_VERIFY\n  Obtain SiI9022A Programming Guide and verify QFN-72\n  pin table against this schematic symbol.\n=============================================================\n"
		(at 10 200 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (face "monospace")) (justify left top))
	)
	(text "POWER SECTION — 5V USB-C INPUT"
		(at 10 95 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left))
	)
	(text "FPGA — XC7A100T-2FGG484I"
		(at 180 95 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left))
	)
	(text "DDR3L MEMORY — MT41K256M16TW x8 (128-bit bus)"
		(at 390 95 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left))
	)
	(text "HDMI OUTPUT"
		(at 620 95 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left))
	)
	(text "CONFIGURATION"
		(at 780 95 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left))
	)
	(text "Power Sequencing (Xilinx UG472):\n1. VCCINT (1.0V) — first\n2. VCCBRAM (1.0V) — simultaneous with VCCINT\n3. VCCAUX (1.8V) — after VCCINT\n4. VCCO (1.35V / 3.3V) — last\nSequenced by PG chain: U1.PG→U2.EN, U2.PG→U3.EN, U3.PG→U4.EN"
		(at 10 160 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
	)
	(text "DDR3L Signal Integrity Notes:\n- 33Ω series resistors on all DQ/DQS lines\n- 33Ω series resistors on CK/CK# differential pair\n- ZQ=240Ω to VSSQ on each DRAM\n- VREFDQ/VREFCA = VCCO_DDR/2 via 1kΩ divider + 1uF filter\n- Match DQ lengths within ±10mil, DQS to DQ within ±5mil\n- Address bus: fly-by topology, 33Ω source termination\n- Route DDR3 on inner layers for impedance control\n- Target 50Ω single-ended, 100Ω differential"
		(at 390 160 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
	)
